quiet.md #32: right-align wrapped right-to-left paragraphs

WrappedLine::paint / paint_background: a paragraph that wraps onto several
rows and whose first letter belongs to a right-to-left script turns the
default left alignment into right alignment, so multi-line Arabic or Hebrew
descriptions sit against the right edge. Single rows, an explicit alignment
and paint_rows (the editor) are unchanged.

